    "title_en": "An X-ray Extremely wide-field Spectroscopic Surveyor (XESS, or \"chess\")",
    "abstract_en": "We propose an X-ray observatory, the X-ray Extremely wide-field Spectroscopic Surveyor (XESS, pronounced \"Chess\") to bring high energy resolution X-ray spectroscopy into the era of synoptic surveys and of time domain and multi-messenger astrophysics (TDAMM). Such an observatory is optimally suited to addressing key elements of the 2020 Decadal Survey on Astronomy and Astrophysics.",
